# Nothing of Konami's belongs in this repository. tools/pes21_import/ rebuilds all
# of it from your own installation; docs/PES21_IMPORT.md is the runbook.
#
# 4cc material is a different question, decided per asset. A team's crest and kits
# are committed, because databases/default/database.sqlite names them and a clone
# without them dies with "There is no loader for databases/default/" the moment
# that team is picked. The packs themselves, and the bodies and animations built
# from them, stay out.

# source packs and reference material
*.pdf
*AET/
* AET/
HDG VGL26 AET/
HDG AET/
2HUG Aesthetics VGL26/
2HUG AET/
data/imports/
__pycache__/

